kien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-07T07:49:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T07:50:52Z","body":"@m4gr3d The script indeed needs to be called manually and @Repiteo wasn't aware that it's the case for 3.x.\n\nI just ran it though and it fails:\n```\n> Task :releaseSonatypeStagingRepository FAILED\n\nFAILURE: Build failed with an exception.\n\n* What went wrong:\nExecution failed for task ':releaseSonatypeStagingRepository'.\n> Failed to release staging repository, server at https://ossrh-staging-api.central.sonatype.com/service/local/ responded with status code 400, body: Failed to process request: Publish request failed\n```\n\nWe're using the same credentials as for 4.7, where it works. So I suspect the issue lies with the gradle config in 3.6.\n\nPossibly missing this:\n3a36726febf","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5567215691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5567361166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108161#issuecomment-5567361166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108161","id":5567361166,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS9cwjg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-07T08:01:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T08:01:35Z","body":"> Possibly missing this:\n> [3a36726](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/3a36726febf304f878857ba0e5ecc8b56e7e04b1)\n\nWith a partial chery-pick of this commit (only the `publish-root.gradle` chunk is valid, the rest depends on 9dc0543da7323e970f4349e65b416ef31056df20), it seems to work, kind of.\n\n```\n> Task :initializeSonatypeStagingRepository\nCreated staging repository '8e80cdd922418--13f54b13-e25c-44fb-b90a-87cfa04476a2' at https://ossrh-staging-api.central.sonatype.com/service/local/repositories/8e80cdd922418--13f54b13-e25c-44fb-b90a-87cfa04476a2/content/\n\n> Task :closeSonatypeStagingRepository FAILED\n\nFAILURE: Build failed with an exception.\n\n* What went wrong:\nExecution failed for task ':closeSonatypeStagingRepository'.\n> Failed to close staging repository, server at https://ossrh-staging-api.central.sonatype.com/service/local/ responded with status code 400, body: Failed to process request: Deployment reached an unexpected status: Failed\n  pkg:maven/org.godotengine/godot@3.6.3.stable?type=aar\n  - Component with package url: 'pkg:maven/org.godotengine/godot@3.6.3.stable?type=aar' already exists\n```\n\nThe entry is properly listed now:\n- https://central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.godotengine/godot/3.6.3.stable\n- https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/godotengine/godot/3.6.3.stable/\n\nI assume the error might be because my previous attempt to run `upload-mavencentral.sh` fails but still uploaded stuff to staging, just couldn't publish it. So re-running it successfully published but threw an error due to the already present upload.\n\nThe files have timestamps from ~20 min ago which supports this theory:\n<img width=\"586\" height=\"198\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2210c60-4239-40a1-9656-477bd8236598\" />\n\nSo it might work with just this partial cherry-pick going forward.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5567361166/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5567411062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108161#issuecomment-5567411062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108161","id":5567411062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS9fzdg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-07T08:06:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T08:06:01Z","body":"I see #108393 was already backported to `3.x` with #108433.\n\nI don't think we want to update the NDK in `3.6` unless we have to, but the maven repo change is needed. @m4gr3d @syntaxerror247 Could you make a PR for that?\n\nFor reference, what I tried locally now to upload 3.6.3-stable to mavencentral was just:\n```diff\nFrom 5c24b907c246b90f4fa88015778bb41c97ee0580 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\nFrom: Fredia Huya-Kouadio <fhuyakou@gmail.com>\nDate: Mon, 7 Jul 2025 15:57:04 -0700\nSubject: [PATCH] Update the maven publishing configuration following the\n deprecation of the OSSHR service\n\nhttps://central.sonatype.org/news/20250326_ossrh_sunset/\n(cherry picked from commit 3a36726febf304f878857ba0e5ecc8b56e7e04b1)\n---\n platform/android/java/scripts/publish-root.gradle | 4 ++--\n 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n\ndiff --git a/platform/android/java/scripts/publish-root.gradle b/platform/android/java/scripts/publish-root.gradle\nindex ae88487c34..438f595ee7 100644\n--- a/platform/android/java/scripts/publish-root.gradle\n+++ b/platform/android/java/scripts/publish-root.gradle\n@@ -31,8 +31,8 @@ nexusPublishing {\n             stagingProfileId = sonatypeStagingProfileId\n             username = ossrhUsername\n             password = ossrhPassword\n-            nexusUrl.set(uri(\"https://s01.oss.sonatype.org/service/local/\"))\n-            snapshotRepositoryUrl.set(uri(\"https://s01.oss.sonatype.org/content/repositories/snapshots/\"))\n+            nexusUrl.set(uri(\"https://ossrh-staging-api.central.sonatype.com/service/local/\"))\n+            snapshotRepositoryUrl.set(uri(\"https://central.sonatype.com/repository/maven-snapshots/\"))\n         }\n     }\n }\n-- \n2.55.0\n```\n\nBut I see #108433 also adds the URL to a bunch more locations like #108393 did, so I'll let you assess whether it's needed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5567411062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]